2026-10-26T12:27:37Z","value":403,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4895870","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2870790-1846651706690146","game_id":"steam-2870790","kind":"announcement","title":"Dumpster Gang DEMO out now!!!","summary":"Gang! The big day is finally here! Christmas? No, it's better than Christmas. (Sorry, Santa.) It's the first day of Steam Next Fest and we're as giddy as a raccoon on garbage day. Why? You can play the demo for Dumpster Gang RIGHT NOW!!!! CAN WE GET SOME RACCOONS IN THE CHAT?? 🦝🦝🦝 That's right - the Dumpster Gang demo is out now! And that's not all. We're ready to make ANOTHER exciting announcement! Our full game releases on December 3rd!!! PLAY THE DEMO NOW! Dumpster Gang is part of Steam Next ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:09:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690146","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2870790-1846018067940868","game_id":"steam-2870790","kind":"announcement","title":"Dumpster Gang DEMO releases October 19th!","summary":"Gang! We've got a big announcement! We've been secretly working on a surprise for y'all, and to be honest we're going a lil crazy keeping it to ourselves hahaha --DUMPSTER GANG. FREE DEMO. OCTOBER 19TH.IT'S TRUE! Starting October 19th, you'll be able to play Dumpster Gang for yourself with a free demo launching at Steam Next Fest! That means a truly tantalizing SNEAK PEEK at some of the craziness coming to our full game. Explore levels! Wreak havoc! Look stylish?! If you've ever wondered what li","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T13:01:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940868","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2870790-1843481262689892","game_id":"steam-2870790","kind":"announcement","title":"100,000 wishlists!!!","summary":"Arghhhh! Why are there so many raccoons on my porch? Hang on a second, let me count. 1… 2… 100,000?! (Must be a gigantic porch.) Gang! We are blown away to share that, in just about two weeks after it was announced, Dumpster Gang has already hit 100,000 wishlists on Steam! We are truly honored that so many of you are excited for what we’re creating and could not be more touched by all the kind words. When you’re making a game, you can’t really anticipate how people are going to react to it, and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T17:00:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262689892","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2870790-1842212951297023","game_id":"steam-2870790","kind":"announcement","title":"Dumpster Gang is coming December 2026","summary":"Attention all raccoons! It’s Sam and Jake here, developers of Dumpster Gang! We're so excited to finally introduce this chaotic co-op sandbox! Dang, it’s been tough to keep this one a secret... Grab up to four players or go solo as you play as mischievous raccoons causing as much mayhem as possible. Steal shiny junk. Knock over trash cans. Raid snacks. Escape a very angry exterminator. Amass the greatest hoard the forest has ever known. Basically... live your best raccoon life. Our very first tr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T14:11:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297023","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_on